1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,140
Every morning, an old fisherman pushed

2
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:07,060
his small boat into the sea before sunrise.

3
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:10,500
The waves were cold and the nets were heavy.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,840
One stormy day he came back with nothing.

5
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:14,840
But the next morning,

6
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:16,860
he went out again.

7
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,780
That is how he taught his grandson

8
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:21,720
that patience is a kind of courage.
